+### NeRFPlayer
+A method for large-scale urban reconstruction from aerial drone images using NeRF++ inverse sphere parameterization extended to ellipsoids. It focuses on caching coarse renderings into an octree for faster inference. [Link](9440-nerfplayer.md)
