+### Spatial Partitioning for Distributed NeRF
+A method that decouples rendering time from scene size by dividing the scene into blocks, each represented by a small MLP, and aligning appearances between adjacent NeRFs for seamless integration. [Link](10332-spatial-partitioning-for-distributed-nerf.md)
